turing services. In addition, the company offers neurology, cardiology and diabetology products for the treatment of hypertension, stable angina, and CHF. Further, the company provides agro chemicals and biological pest management solutions for management of insects, diseases, and weeds across a range of crops. NATCO Pharma Limited was incorporated in 1981 and is headquartered in Hyderabad, India."}}